		{
			String _name = "BlastFurnaceProductTip";
			String _text = "Controls the type of input materials required to operate the blast furnace and create Iron, Copper, Tin or Bronze. For all metals apart from Bronze, the furnace will require 5 ores and either 2 Coke or Charcoal as the fuel. An advanced option is available to create the native metal from only 3 ores, 1 Lime & either 2 Coke or Charcoal. The lime acts as a flux, making removing impurities easy without the loss, meaning less ore is used. Bronze is smelted in a larger amount, directly from a mixture of Copper Ore with a smaller quantity of Tin Ore added.";
		}
